<title>FRANCE: OECD - Key forecast by half year - France.</title>
<headline>OECD - Key forecast by half year - France.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are economic forecasts for France made by the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development and published on Thursday in its half-yearly economic outlook.</p>
<p>		    1996  1997  1998     1996	 1997	 1998</p>
<p>		    year  year  year    H1  H2     H1  H2     H1  H2</p>
<p> Real GDP	  1.5   2.5   2.8   2.1  1.5   2.7  2.9   2.8 2.8</p>
<p>(pct change annual rate)</p>
<p> Inflation pct   1.2   1.0   1.4   1.1  0.6   1.1  1.3   1.4 1.5</p>
<p>(GDP deflator)</p>
<p> Current account 1.3   1.7   2.0   0.7  1.9   1.6  1.8   1.8 1.8</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p>Unemployment  12.4  12.6  12.2  12.2 12.6  12.7 12.5  12.3 12.1</p>
<p>(pct of labour force)</p>
</text>
